eground/20 hover:border-foreground/50 transition-colors flex-shrink-0"><svg width="8" height="10" viewBox="0 0 8 10" fill="currentColor" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458"><polygon points="0,0 8,5 0,10" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458"></polygon></svg></button><div style="height:10px" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458 flex items-end gap-[2px]"><span style="height:100%;animation:none;transform:scaleY(0.2);transform-origin:bottom;transition:transform 0.2s ease" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458 w-[2px] rounded-full bg-foreground/40"></span><span style="height:100%;animation:none;transform:scaleY(0.2);transform-origin:bottom;transition:transform 0.2s ease" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458 w-[2px] rounded-full bg-foreground/40"></span><span style="height:100%;animation:none;transform:scaleY(0.2);transform-origin:bottom;transition:transform 0.2s ease" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458 w-[2px] rounded-full bg-foreground/40"></span><span style="height:100%;animation:none;transform:scaleY(0.2);transform-origin:bottom;transition:transform 0.2s ease" class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458 w-[2px] rounded-full bg-foreground/40"></span></div><p class="jsx-3385b245a0c0b458 font-mono text-[9px] tracking-widest text-muted uppercase">Lost Library - OMORI OST</p></div></div><div class="hidden sm:flex relative flex-1 justify-center pointer-events-none select-none sm:order-2"><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -z-10" style="inset:-20px -28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border-radius:50%;filter:blur(24px)"></div><p class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase text-muted">drag to orbit &nbsp;·&nbsp; space + drag to pan &nbsp;·&nbsp; scroll to zoom</p></div></div><div class="relative order-1 sm:order-3"><div class="absolute -z-10" style="inset:-20px -28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border-radius:50%;filter:blur(24px)"></div><span class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase text-muted">[ submissions closed ]</span></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script src="js/f1b4d49aa9e249c5.js" i