orage/v1/object/sign/backgrounds/03-heatwaves.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJiYWNrZ3JvdW5kcy8wMy1oZWF0d2F2ZXMucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczNjAwNzUxLCJleHAiOjIwNTc0MjQ3NTF9.Ug1bswHftC7hNXhDZjFokMOL8Jg62nV64KKSwCA0dtU\",\"polaroid_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/polaroid-images/03.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwb2xhcm9pZC1pbWFnZXMvMDMucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxMTE3MzY2LCJleHAiOjE5Mjg3OTczNjZ9.gqJgEPn469ZjI5ccG4ar0i_PlORTrb5pSd0RmFnaatM\",\"song_name\":\"please please please by sabrina carpenter\",\"accent_color\":\"#CC8725\",\"text_color\":\"#212353\",\"frosted_fill_color\":\"#FFE299\\n\",\"volume\":0.5},{\"id\":\"04\",\"slug\":\"all-love-no-bite\",\"title\":\"all love no bite\",\"author\":\"s\",\"recipient\":\"r\",\"body\":\"dear r,\\n\\ni’m glad we met at the time we did, you have no idea how much you’ve impacted my life in every way possible. you taught me how to love myself even at a time when i could not understand how anyone could. thank you for that and i hope you’re doing well (ps. ur new gf looks kinda like me, seems like u really got a type loll) \\n\\nlove, c\",\"audio_url\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/love-songs/Honey%20Jam%20Royalty%20Free%20Lofi%20Music.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJsb3ZlLXNvbmdzL0hvbmV5IEphbSBSb3lhbHR5IEZyZWUgTG9maSBNdXNpYy5tcDMiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzIzOTMyMDgsImV4cCI6MjA1NjIxNzIwOH0.Jc-b4tXcNg6snhlafQjZV3HSud_J6C2Km6gTg71R9mc\",\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-02-08T18:34:01+00:00\",\"cover_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/envelopes/04.avif?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mY