teejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/envelopes/05.avif?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJlbnZlbG9wZXMvMDUuYXZpZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MTExNjk0NCwiZXhwIjoxOTI4Nzk2OTQ0fQ.rGOkEl-JuPU1jo1okitthzovhg-DLPej0EPI-I8wK_8\",\"background_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/backgrounds/05-real.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJiYWNrZ3JvdW5kcy8wNS1yZWFsLnBuZyIsInNjb3BlIjoiZG93bmxvYWQiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODE0Njk1NDAsImV4cCI6MjA2NTI5MzU0MH0.lNuda8fBdPm6M7QFQjoy5aB465FVt2cmJU8r-UAlsjc\",\"polaroid_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/polaroid-images/05.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwb2xhcm9pZC1pbWFnZXMvMDUucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxMTE3Mzg4LCJleHAiOjE5Mjg3OTczODh9.DBH45hLWVEvReNiLej-7iqM-iSgB3eoC8MsvhL29rWY\",\"song_name\":\"keep smiling by demxntia\",\"accent_color\":\"#7D6DA2\",\"text_color\":\"#7D6DA2\",\"frosted_fill_color\":\"#FBEBFF\",\"volume\":1},{\"id\":\"06\",\"slug\":\"past-meets-present\",\"title\":\"past meets present\",\"author\":\"the present version of myself\",\"recipient\":\"S\",\"body\":\"Dear S,\\n\\nThere’s a version of myself that would run back to you. To feel your embrace once more. To brush my fingers through your hair. \\n\\nThe pain subsides every now and then but it comes back out in the quiet of the night. \\n\\nI wonder how you’ve been. \\n\\nI hope you’ve been well. \\n\\nSelfishly I hope you’ve been missing me too. \\n\\nThere’s a version of myself that would run back to you but that version now lives in the past.\\n\\nWith all my heart,\\nThe present version of myself \",\"audio_url\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/love-songs/Calm%20Sea%20Waves.mp3?token=eyJraWQi