't matter that we don't speak anymore - i don't know what you're up to or where you are. i think about you every day. i hope you're doing well, i hope you find what you're looking for, and i hope you find so much love it makes you giddy.\\n\\ni know what it means to love someone because of you. you're the first person i ever loved. it hurts, but thank you. i don't think i'll stop loving you. i don't know how to. \\n\\nonce yours,\\nxx\",\"audio_url\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/love-songs/Coldplay%20Yellow%20Lyrics.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJsb3ZlLXNvbmdzL0NvbGRwbGF5IFllbGxvdyBMeXJpY3MubXAzIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxNDg4MTQ0LCJleHAiOjIwNTUzMTIxNDR9.TOGy6O4fjwlCyZEeQAKyig45aTu3nu57z7WPXmzwoF8\",\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-02-14T20:03:19+00:00\",\"cover_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/envelopes/14.avif?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJlbnZlbG9wZXMvMTQuYXZpZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MTQ4ODEzMiwiZXhwIjoyMDU1MzEyMTMyfQ.TJzg4A8hzqjILln7ZwpI9_XpfiV6fMYTS7AdWsAzErA\",\"background_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/backgrounds/14-real.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJiYWNrZ3JvdW5kcy8xNC1yZWFsLnBuZyIsInNjb3BlIjoiZG93bmxvYWQiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODE0Njg2NTMsImV4cCI6MjA2NTI5MjY1M30.ndwrIe7M3qJxg5kof7sm-yhHCRQGbTHcJwUpP79mZDk\",\"polaroid_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/polaroid-images/14.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwb2xhcm9pZC1pbWFnZXMvMTQucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxNzkxMTY5LCJleHAiOjE5Mjk0NzExNjl9.8yckrYWCVtlPK1s7cQIOtL74umOEhO4B665cRsYSVsc\",\"song_name\":\"Yellow by Coldplay\",\"accent_color\":\"#413021\",\"text_color\":\"#FDFABE\",\"frosted_fill_color\":\"#413021\",\"volume\":1},{\"id\":\"15\",\"slug\":\"music\",\"title\":\"music\",\"author\":\"p\",\"recipient\":\"d\",\"body\":\"dear d,\\n\\nit's been years since we were close but i still dream about you. i hope one day i have the balls to ask you whether you liked me back in high school. you were so different when you were around me; so real. i will never meet someone as funny, brilliant and secretly caring as you were. i still remember fighting over maths sums with you (you were always right somehow) and walking back home together after school (that was the best part of my day). i think our paths will never cross again but you should know that i look for you in every person i meet.\\n\\ni hope you're doing well and one day i can tell you how much you meant to me (and my mom lol she absolutely loved you)\\n\\nlove, p\",\"audio_url\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/love-songs/Love%20Dreams%20Lofi%20Beat.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJsb3ZlLXNvbmdzL0xvdmUgRHJlYW1zIExvZmkgQmVhdC5tcDMiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzIzOTM0MzgsImV4cCI6MjA1NjIxNzQzOH0.jWRQKaslHzkwIabQ5KCmb-KmmDjkGvwiDguVFi2j9-o\",\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-02-15T14:29:14+00:00\",\"cover_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/envelopes/15.avif?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJlbnZlbG9wZXMvMTUuYXZpZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MTQ4ODI5NywiZXhwIjoyMDU1MzEyMjk3fQ.nUNXUZLxfXLvj3PUIV91RdRWmvmCVUSsq3mOY3P51XQ\",\"background_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/backgrounds/15-real.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.ey