pK3Rq-TEY\",\"polaroid_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/polaroid-images/16.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwb2xhcm9pZC1pbWFnZXMvMTYucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxNDg3NjA0LCJleHAiOjIwNTUzMTE2MDR9.j7bGzc16ZuhuKkfeU-HhnYaS0GZKA6Wx5pcaOqMOVBc\",\"song_name\":\"Happy I'm by UMI\",\"accent_color\":\"#2E5458\",\"text_color\":\"#2E5458\",\"frosted_fill_color\":\"#FFF9FC\",\"volume\":1},{\"id\":\"17\",\"slug\":\"l\",\"title\":\"L\",\"author\":\"A\",\"recipient\":\"L\",\"body\":\"Dear L,\\n\\nIt saddens me in Valentine's Day we're over before we even begin, before I know how it feels in my stomach when we touch.\\n\\nI wonder how you feel a lot. How you smell when we hug, whether your moustache tickles when we kiss.\\n\\nI'll miss when you call me love, before knowing what is even falling in love. You're strange, but a lovely person. I hope you know that. Thank you for making me smile in the middle of my day (timezone gap!). \\n\\nThis reminds me moment is short and the longest we'll ever get.\\n\\nLove,\\nA\",\"audio_url\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/love-songs/Time%20Machine%20-%20MJ%20Apanay%20ft.%20Aren%20Park.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJsb3ZlLXNvbmdzL1RpbWUgTWFjaGluZSAtIE1KIEFwYW5heSBmdC4gQXJlbiBQYXJrLm1wMyIsInNjb3BlIjoiZG93bmxvYWQiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODE0NjM4NDYsImV4cCI6MjA2NTI4Nzg0Nn0.tmXjF2-Mqt5ht4kuYDQhcuDYErTwKF8TRdHQYOZYsvM\",\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-02-17T07:12:07+00:00\",\"cover_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/envelopes/17.avif?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJlbnZlbG9wZXMvMTcuYXZpZiIsImlhdCI6MTc3MTQ4ODMyMywiZXhwIjoyMDU1MzEyMzIzfQ.EUljDr7gCfgp