Zbr5FyrP9x7K5Q\",\"background_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/backgrounds/18-real.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJiYWNrZ3JvdW5kcy8xOC1yZWFsLnBuZyIsInNjb3BlIjoiZG93bmxvYWQiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODE0Njg3MTMsImV4cCI6MjA2NTI5MjcxM30.6feY6bv3WhaLjTFJU3Kr7eBnxkSf0w9dibi1p0M6CeE\",\"polaroid_image\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/polaroid-images/18.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwb2xhcm9pZC1pbWFnZXMvMTgucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcxNzkxMTA2LCJleHAiOjE5Mjk0NzExMDZ9.NmKb8ec1Pm947p92l7t2QiijFc5ZZqePxVeXKp1k3fQ\",\"song_name\":\"I Bet on Losing Dogs by Mitski\",\"accent_color\":\"#CC789B\",\"text_color\":\"#CC789B\",\"frosted_fill_color\":\"#FFF9FC\",\"volume\":1},{\"id\":\"19\",\"slug\":\"riding-a-bike-in-copenhagen\",\"title\":\"riding a bike in copenhagen\",\"author\":\"V\",\"recipient\":\"N\",\"body\":\"Dear N,\\n\\nIt's been almost a month from our last day, even though I feel better I've found myself crying in the most random places: while reading in a cafe, the supermarket, even at a cycling class because it reminded me of Copenhagen. I'm a little afraid to ask you how are you for real, besides work, and the mundane I would like to know how are you feeling inside. I miss you, I miss the simple days with you, but I'm also feeling better little by little in this city I deeply love and we shared one day, and I'll keep that memory forever in me.\\n\\nYou're looking good, I hope you know it. \\n\\nwith love, \\n\\nV.\",\"audio_url\":\"https://tbwqrdimtyoqsbteejna.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/love-songs/Ted%20Lucas%20-%2005.%20Baby%20Where%20You%20Are%20%20Ted%20Lucas.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV9hMjBiNzMxZS04OWU0LTQ5OTYtYjAxNi1mYWYyMmMwZjk0ZGUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJsb3ZlLXNvbmd